      "type": "text",
      "content": "*** This is one of the Pancha-Pandava Kshethrams. This temple is said to have been established by Arjuna.\n\nSthala Puranam:\nThis kshethram is believed to have been built by Arjuna, one of the Pandavas. It is also believed that Lord Vishnu revealed Himself to Lord Brahma and Maharishi Vedavyasa at this kshethram.",
